<span id="Properties"></span>
== Eigenschaften ==

Siehe auch: [[Property_View/de|Eigenschaften-Ansicht]].

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
A PartDesign '''PathPattern''' object is derived from a [[...]] object and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional properties:
</div>

<span id="Data"></span>
=== Daten ===

{{Properties_Title|Base}}

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* {{PropertyData|Originals|LinkList|}}: A list of selected features. Will be ignored, if the {{PropertyData|Transform Mode}} property is set to {{value|Whole shape}}.
* {{PropertyData|Transform Mode|Enumeration|}}:
*: {{value|Features}} (default)
*: {{value|Whole shape}}.
</div>

{{Properties_Title|Part Design}}

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* {{PropertyData|Refine|Bool|}}: Default is {{value|True}}. Refine shape (clean up redundant edges) after operations.
* {{PropertyData|Fuzzy Tolerance|FloatConstraint|}}: Default is {{value|-1.0}}. Fuzzy tolerance:
*: If value > 0: use the value
*: If value = 0: leave default value
*: If value < 0: determine value
</div>

{{Properties_Title|PathPattern}}

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* {{PropertyData|Path|LinkSub}}: Path edges used by the pattern.
* {{PropertyData|Count|IntegerConstraint}}: Maximum number of occurrences.
* {{PropertyData|Spacing Mode|Enumeration}}: Selects how to control occurrences, options are:
*: {{value|Fixed count}} (default)
*: {{value|Fixed spacing}}
*: {{value|Fixed count and spacing}}
* {{PropertyData|Spacing|Length|hidden}}: Distance between occurrences..
* {{PropertyData|Start Offset|Length}}: Default is {{value|0.0 mm}}. Unused distance at path start.
* {{PropertyData|End Offset|Length}}: Default is {{value|0.0 mm}}. Unused distance at path end.
* {{PropertyData|Reverse Path|Bool}}: Default is {{value|False}}. Traverses the path in reverse.
* {{PropertyData|Align|Bool}}: Default is {{value|True}}. Aligns the occurrence X axes to the path.
* {{PropertyData|Vertical Vector|Vector}}: Default is {{value|Vector (0.0, 0.0, 1.0)}}. Preferred local Z direction when aligning occurrences.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
{{Properties_Title|Transformation}}
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* {{PropertyData|Suppressed Indices|IntegerList}}: Indices of pattern instances that are suppressed.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
==Notes==
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* If a sketch is used, the path should start at the sketch origin, and the origins of sketch and feature to be duplicated should be coincident for clarity reasons, or else the locations of the pattern elements may appear a bit weird.
</div>


